    "description": {
      "value": "\n<p><em>“The land knows whose teeth marks live here.”</em></p><p><strong>Apex Den.</strong> You can spend 10 minutes claiming a 6 squares-radius area as your den. Until you take a Soma Break or claim a new den, while you are within that area:</p><ul><li><p>You reroll the lowest die on initiative rolls.</p></li><li><p>The first time you hit a creature in your den each round, the attack deals an additional 1d6 damage of the weapon’s type.</p></li><li><p>You always know if any Medium or larger creature crosses the boundary while you are inside.</p></li></ul><p>You can have only one den at a time.</p>",
